2026-07-27T11:08:19.1525969Z i /tmp/RtmpxRJQTO/duckdb
2026-07-27T11:08:19.1526280Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T11:08:19.1526628Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T11:08:19.1526932Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T11:08:19.1527402Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T11:08:19.1528061Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T11:08:19.1528943Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
